sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario (Terminal)
    participant CLI as CLI (clap)
    participant Router as EmailClient (Router)
    participant ImapAdapt as IMAP Backend
    participant SmtpTransport as SMTP Transport
    participant ImapServer as Servidor IMAP
    participant SmtpServer as Servidor SMTP

    User->>CLI: himalaya message send < msg.eml
    CLI->>Router: send_message(raw_bytes)
    Note over Router: Backend es IMAP (no sabe enviar)
    Router->>SmtpTransport: smtp_client_mut() (lazy connect)
    SmtpTransport->>SmtpServer: Handshake TLS + SASL
    SmtpServer-->>SmtpTransport: OK
    Router->>SmtpTransport: send_message(raw_bytes)
    SmtpTransport->>SmtpServer: DATA + mensaje crudo
    SmtpServer-->>SmtpTransport: OK (Aceptado)

    Note over Router: SMTP no guarda en Enviados. IMAP debe hacerlo.
    Router->>ImapAdapt: add_message("Sent", flags, raw_bytes)
    ImapAdapt->>ImapServer: APPEND "Sent" {flags} <mensaje>
    ImapServer-->>ImapAdapt: OK (APPENDUID ...)
    ImapAdapt-->>Router: uid
    Router-->>CLI: OK
    CLI-->>User: Mensaje enviado (stdout)
